<p>SpaceX has fundamentally changed the economics. Over 9,000 Starlink satellites in orbit—that's two-thirds of ALL satellites. They launch every two days on average. They've achieved a 10,000x improvement in dollar-per-gigabyte of satellite capacity.</p>
